Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:25:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] worker-isolation: parent-enforced pipeline/job deadlines,
 parent-death watchdog, retry parity, permit/background-work guarantees

- Parent enforces PIPELINE_TIMEOUT_MS and job deadlineAt with immediate SIGKILL;
  cancel/revoke and exit graces never outlive a deadline
- Child parent-death watchdog worker_thread (survives coordinator SIGKILL);
  Chromium (detached) pid registered as a descendant group
- classifyIsolatedOutcome: one row per outcome matching in-process results;
  retry policy + Cancelled fence extracted verbatim to retry-policy.ts
- Outcome delivered only after child exit, group reap and permit release;
  withdrawn queued IPC acquisitions removed; children niced
- Tests A1,B1,B2,C,D,D6,E1,E1b,E2/E3,E4,F1,G1 (22/22). Gate stays OFF.
